{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 34, "model_name": "stockmark/stockmark-2-100b-instruct", "content": "Dear traveler, lend thine ear to a journey through Japan, a land of splendor and grace, where cherry blossoms whisper tales of old and mountains stand sentinel over the valleys below.\n\nFirst, thou shalt arrive in Tokyo, the bustling heart of the land, where modernity and tradition dance hand in hand. There, behold the majesty of the Tokyo Tower, reaching toward the heavens, and the serene beauty of the Meiji Shrine, where the spirits of the past and present mingle.\n\nThen, make thy way to Kyoto, the city of a thousand temples. Wander through the Arashiyama Bamboo Grove, where the towering stalks of green create a celestial path, and visit the Kinkaku-ji, the Golden Pavilion, where the sun's rays turn the structure into a gleaming beacon.\n\nNext, venture to Nara, where the deer roam freely, and the temples of Todai-ji and Kasuga Taisha stand as testaments to the enduring spirit of the ancients.\n\nAfterward, journey to Hiroshima, a city of peace and remembrance. Reflect at the Memorial Park, where the Cenotaph and the A-bomb Dome speak of a tragic past and a hopeful future.\n\nLastly, conclude thy journey in Osaka, the city of culinary delights. Savor the flavors of takoyaki and okonomiyaki, and partake in the vibrant energy of Dotonbori, where the night comes alive with neon lights and cheerful laughter.\n\nThus, thy journey through Japan, a tapestry of contrasts and beauties, shall be etched in thy memory, a story to be told for ages to come.", "logprobs": [{"token": "Dear", "logprob": -5.335517883300781}, {"token": " traveler", "logprob": -0.3762669563293457}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.03398562967777252}, {"token": " lend", "logprob": -1.2961331605911255}, {"token": " th", "logprob": -0.22059887647628784}, {"token": "ine", "logprob": -3.755022044060752e-05}, {"token": " ear", "logprob": -0.16230909526348114}, {"token": " to", "logpro